cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Forecast-Quality Analysis Agent: an LLM Agent for Supply Chain Planners"
abstract: >-
  An evaluation of whether an LLM agent that calls forecasting tools answers supply chain planners' questions
  about forecast quality (error, bias, prediction interval coverage) more accurately than the same LLM without
  tools, using reference answers computed from M5 retail forecasts.
authors:
